<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97313" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόφ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρέφω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twisted band</i> or <i>cord</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δὲ ς. ἦεν ἀορτήρ</span> on it (the wallet) was
				<i>a cord</i> to hang it by, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.438
			</span></i>: generally, <i>cord, rope</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1631.336
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>women's girdle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				872
			</span></i> (anap.); prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόβους</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				457
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>swaddling-band,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ap.
				122
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				128
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>twisting of the bowels, colic</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. μ᾽ ἔχει τὴν γαστέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					484
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Damox.
				2.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.263
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
